    "closed": true,
    "closedAt": "2024-08-27T11:27:19Z",
    "comment_count": 1,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                "login": "echasnovski",
                "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, there is a [`MiniFilesNormal`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/42744fd81136fdd7e01ce81fb99fc6b5e9a17f0f/doc/mini-files.txt#L94) highlight group. You can modify it as any other highlight group. For example, with the following Lua call: `vim.api.nvim_set_hl(0, 'MiniFilesNormal', { bg = '#111111' })`.\r\n\r\nBut more so, this sounds like the color scheme you are using doesn't show floating windows with the distinctive background color. I'd recommend adjusting `NormalFloat` highlight group.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Yes, there is a <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/42744fd81136fdd7e01ce81fb99fc6b5e9a17f0f/doc/mini-files.txt#L94\"><code class=\"notranslate\">MiniFilesNormal</code></a> highlight group. You can modify it as any other highlight group. For example, with the following Lua call: <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.api.nvim_set_hl(0, 'MiniFilesNormal', { bg = '#111111' })</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">But more so, this sounds like the color scheme you are using doesn't show floating windows with the distinctive background color. I'd recommend adjusting <code class=\"notranslate\">NormalFloat</code> highlight group.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Yes, there is a MiniFilesNormal highlight group. You can modify it as any other highlight group. For example, with the following Lua call: vim.api.nvim_set_hl(0, 'MiniFilesNormal', { bg = '#111111' }).\nBut more so, this sounds like the color scheme you are using doesn't show floating windows with the distinctive background color. I'd recommend adjusting NormalFloat highlight group.",
